xref:exists_[Some of ``bool^{asterisk}^`` is true]

. If ``bool^{asterisk}^`` matches pattern ``[]``: return ``false``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``bool'`` be xref:exists_[some of ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` is true].
 .. Return ``b~h~`` or ``bool'``.

xref:forall_[All ``bool^{asterisk}^`` are true]

. If ``bool^{asterisk}^`` matches pattern ``[]``: return ``true``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``bool'`` be xref:forall_[all ``b~t~^{asterisk}^`` are true].
 .. Return ``b~h~`` and ``bool'``.

xref:init_[The list of the first ``nat'`` natural numbers]

. If ``nat'`` is equal to ``0``:
 .. Return ``·``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``n'`` be ``nat'`` - ``1``.
 .. Let ``nat^{asterisk}^`` be xref:init_[the list of the first ``n'`` natural numbers].
 .. Return ``n' {two-colons} nat^{asterisk}^``.

xref:repeat_[A list of ``nat'`` copies of ``X``]

. If ``nat'`` is equal to ``0``:
 .. Return ``·``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``n'`` be ``nat'`` - ``1``.
 .. Let ``X'^{asterisk}^`` be xref:repeat_[a list of ``n'`` copies of ``X``].
 .. Return ``X`` concatenated with ``X'^{asterisk}^``.

