xref:filter_[``X^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``bool^{asterisk}^``]

. If ``X^{asterisk}^`` matches pattern ``[]``:
 .. Check that ``bool^{asterisk}^`` is an empty list.

 .. Return ``·``.
. Else:
 .. Let!~type~ ``b~h~ {two-colons} b~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``bool^{asterisk}^``.

 .. If ``b~h~``:
  ... Let ``X'^{asterisk}^`` be xref:filter_[``X~t~^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``b~t~^{asterisk}^``].
  ... Return ``X~h~ {two-colons} X'^{asterisk}^``.
 .. Else:
  ... Return xref:filter_[``X~t~^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``b~t~^{asterisk}^``].

