xref:subst_typeIR'[``typeIR'''`` substituted by a non-empty ``theta``]

. If let ``baseTypeIR`` be ``typeIR'''``:
 .. Return ``baseTypeIR``.
. Else if let ``typeId`` be ``typeIR'''``:
 .. Try:
  ... {empty}
   .... Let ``typeIR`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:find_map[the value of ``typeId`` in map ``theta``].
   .... Return ``typeIR``.
  ... {empty}
   .... Check that ``·`` is equal to xref:find_map[the value of ``typeId`` in map ``theta``].

   .... Return ``typeId``.
. Else if let ``+TYPEDEF+ typeId typeIR`` be ``typeIR'''``:
 .. Let ``typeIR~subst~`` be xref:subst_typeIR'[``typeIR`` substituted by a non-empty ``theta``].
