 .. If let ``w~l~ +W+ i~l~`` be ``integerLiteral``:
  ... Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral'`` be ``value'``.

  ... If let ``w~r~ +W+ i~r~`` be ``integerLiteral'``:
   .... Let ``i~l'~`` be xref:shl[the left shift of ``i~l~`` by ``w~r~``].
   .... Let ``i~l''~`` be ``i~l'~`` + ``i~r~``.
   .... Let ``w`` be ``w~l~`` + ``w~r~``.
   .... Let ``i''`` be xref:int_to_bitstr[the bitstring of width ``w`` representing the integer ``i~l''~``].
   .... Return ``w +W+ i''``.
  ... Else if let ``w~r~ +S+ i~r~`` be ``integerLiteral'``:
   .... Let ``i~l'~`` be xref:shl[the left shift of ``i~l~`` by ``w~r~``].
   .... Let ``i~l''~`` be ``i~l'~`` + ``i~r~``.
   .... Let ``w`` be ``w~l~`` + ``w~r~``.
   .... Let ``i''`` be xref:int_to_bitstr[the bitstring of width ``w`` representing the integer ``i~l''~``].
   .... Return ``w +W+ i''``.
 .. Else if let ``w~l~ +S+ i~l~`` be ``integerLiteral``:
  ... Let!~type~ ``integerLiteral'`` be ``value'``.

  ... If let ``w~r~ +W+ i~r~`` be ``integerLiteral'``:
   .... Let ``i~l'~`` be xref:bitstr_to_int[the two's complement representation of bitstring ``i~l~`` of width ``w~l~``].
   .... Let ``i~l''~`` be xref:shl[the left shift of ``i~l'~`` by ``w~r~``].
   .... Let ``i~l'''~`` be ``i~l''~`` + ``i~r~``.
   .... Let ``w`` be ``w~l~`` + ``w~r~``.
   .... Let ``i'''`` be xref:int_to_bitstr[the bitstring of width ``w`` representing the integer ``i~l'''~``].
   .... Return ``w +S+ i'''``.
  ... Else if let ``w~r~ +S+ i~r~`` be ``integerLiteral'``:
   .... Let ``i~l'~`` be xref:bitstr_to_int[the two's complement representation of bitstring ``i~l~`` of width ``w~l~``].
   .... Let ``i~l''~`` be xref:shl[the left shift of ``i~l'~`` by ``w~r~``].
   .... Let ``i~l'''~`` be ``i~l''~`` + ``i~r~``.
   .... Let ``w`` be ``w~l~`` + ``w~r~``.
   .... Let ``i'''`` be xref:int_to_bitstr[the bitstring of width ``w`` representing the integer ``i~l'''~``].
   .... Return ``w +S+ i'''``.

