. Else if let ``+STRUCT+ typeId +<+++_++^{asterisk}^+>+ +{+( ++_++ typeIR~field~ nameIR~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. If let ``+SEQ+ +(+value^{asterisk}^+)+`` be ``sequenceValue``:
  ... Let ``value~cast~`` be xref:cast_op[``value`` casted to type ``typeIR~field~``], for all ``typeIR~field~`` in ``typeIR~field~^{asterisk}^``, ``value`` in ``value^{asterisk}^``, and ``value~cast~`` in ``value~cast~^{asterisk}^``.
  ... Return ``+STRUCT+ typeId +{+( value~cast~ nameIR~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+``.
 .. Else:
  ... Let ``( typeIR~field_given~^{asterisk}^, typeIR~field_rest~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:partition_[$partition_<typeIR>(typeIR~field~^{asterisk}^, the length of value^{asterisk}^)]``.
  ... Let ``value~given~`` be xref:cast_op[``value`` casted to type ``typeIR~field_given~``], for all ``typeIR~field_given~`` in ``typeIR~field_given~^{asterisk}^``, ``value`` in ``value^{asterisk}^``, and ``value~given~`` in ``value~given~^{asterisk}^``.
  ... Let ``value~rest~`` be xref:default[the default value for type ``typeIR~field_rest~``], for all ``typeIR~field_rest~`` in ``typeIR~field_rest~^{asterisk}^`` and ``value~rest~`` in ``value~rest~^{asterisk}^``.
  ... Let ``value~cast~^{asterisk}^`` be ``value~given~^{asterisk}^`` concatenated with ``value~rest~^{asterisk}^``.
  ... Return ``+STRUCT+ typeId +{+( value~cast~ nameIR~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+``.
. Else if let ``+HEADER+ typeId +<+++_++^{asterisk}^+>+ +{+( ++_++ typeIR~field~ nameIR~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. If let ``+SEQ+ +(+value^{asterisk}^+)+`` be ``sequenceValue``:
  ... Let ``value~cast~`` be xref:cast_op[``value`` casted to type ``typeIR~field~``], for all ``typeIR~field~`` in ``typeIR~field~^{asterisk}^``, ``value`` in ``value^{asterisk}^``, and ``value~cast~`` in ``value~cast~^{asterisk}^``.
  ... Return ``+HEADER+ typeId +{+true +;+ ( value~cast~ nameIR~field~ +;+ )^{asterisk}^+}+``.
 .. Else:
  ... Let ``( typeIR~field_given~^{asterisk}^, typeIR~field_rest~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:partition_[$partition_<typeIR>(typeIR~field~^{asterisk}^, the length of value^{asterisk}^)]``.
