xref:sizeof[$sizeof(typeIR, text)]

. If ``text`` is equal to ``"minSizeInBits"``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits[$sizeof_minSizeInBits(typeIR)]``.
. Else if ``text`` is equal to ``"minSizeInBytes"``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBytes[$sizeof_minSizeInBytes(typeIR)]``.
. Else if ``text`` is equal to ``"maxSizeInBits"``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBits[$sizeof_maxSizeInBits(typeIR)]``.
. Else if ``text`` is equal to ``"maxSizeInBytes"``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_maxSizeInBytes[$sizeof_maxSizeInBytes(typeIR)]``.

xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits[$sizeof_minSizeInBits(typeIR)]

. Let ``nat`` be ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Return ``+D+ nat``.

xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR'')]

. If let ``boolTypeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Check that ``boolTypeIR`` matches pattern ``+BOOL+``.

 .. Return ``1``.
. Else if let ``+INT+ +<+w+>+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``w``.
. Else if let ``+BIT+ +<+w+>+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``w``.
. Else if let ``+VARBIT+ +<+++_+++>+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``0``.
. Else if let ``+TYPEDEF+ ++_++ typeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Else if let ``+TYPE+ ++_++ typeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Else if let ``+ENUM+ ++_++ +<+typeIR+>+ +{+++_++^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
. Else if let ``+TUPLE+ +<+typeIR^{asterisk}^+>+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Let ``nat`` be ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``, for all ``typeIR`` in ``typeIR^{asterisk}^`` and ``nat`` in ``nat^{asterisk}^``.
 .. Return xref:sum_nat[sum``+(+`` ``nat^{asterisk}^`` ``+)+``].
. Else if let ``+ARRAY+ typeIR +[+n~size~+]+`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Let ``nat'`` be ``xref:sizeof_minSizeInBits'[$sizeof_minSizeInBits'(typeIR)]``.
 .. Return ``nat'`` * ``n~size~``.
. Else if let ``+HEADER_STACK+ typeIR +[+n~size~+]+`` be ``typeIR''``:
