xref:subexpressions_of_expressionIR[The sub-expressions of ``expressionIR'``]

. If let ``unop typedExpressionIR`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. Return xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR``].
. Else if let ``typedExpressionIR~l~ binop typedExpressionIR~r~`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR'`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~l~``].
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~r~``].
 .. Return ``typedExpressionListIR'`` concatenated with ``typedExpressionListIR''``.
. Else if let ``typedExpressionIR~cond~ +?+ typedExpressionIR~then~ +:+ typedExpressionIR~else~`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR'''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~cond~``].
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR''''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~then~``].
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR'''''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~else~``].
 .. Return ``typedExpressionListIR'''`` concatenated with ``typedExpressionListIR''''`` concatenated with ``typedExpressionListIR'''''``.
. Else if let ``+(+typeIR+)+ typedExpressionIR`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. Return xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR``].
. Else if let ``sequenceExpressionIR`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. If let ``+SEQ+ +{+typedExpressionListIR+}+`` be ``sequenceExpressionIR``:
  ... Return xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionListIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionListIR``].
 .. Else:
  ... Return xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionListIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionListIR``].
. Else if let ``recordExpressionIR`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. If let ``+RECORD+ +{+( nameIR +=+ typedExpressionIR )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``recordExpressionIR``:
  ... Return xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionListIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR^{asterisk}^``].
 .. Else:
  ... Return xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionListIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR^{asterisk}^``].
. Else if let ``memberAccessBaseIR +.+ nameIR`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. Let!~type~ ``typedExpressionIR`` be ``memberAccessBaseIR``.

 .. Return xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR``].
. Else if let ``typedExpressionIR~base~ +[+typedExpressionIR~index~+]+`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR''''''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~base~``].
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR'''''''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~index~``].
 .. Return ``typedExpressionListIR''''''`` concatenated with ``typedExpressionListIR'''''''``.
. Else if let ``typedExpressionIR~base~ +[+typedExpressionIR~hi~ sliceop typedExpressionIR~lo~+]+`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. Check that ``sliceop`` matches pattern ``+:+``.

 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR''''''''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~base~``].
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR'''''''''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~hi~``].
 .. Let ``typedExpressionListIR''''''''''`` be xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR~lo~``].
 .. Return ``typedExpressionListIR''''''''`` concatenated with ``typedExpressionListIR'''''''''`` concatenated with ``typedExpressionListIR''''''''''``.
. Else if let ``callExpressionIR`` be ``expressionIR'``:
 .. If let ``constructorTargetIR +(+argumentIR^{asterisk}^+)+`` be ``callExpressionIR``:
  ... Return xref:subexpressions_of_argumentListIR[the sub-expressions of ``argumentIR^{asterisk}^``].
 .. Else:
  ... Return xref:subexpressions_of_argumentListIR[the sub-expressions of ``argumentIR^{asterisk}^``].
. Else:
 .. Return xref:subexpressions_of_typedExpressionIR[the sub-expressions of ``typedExpressionIR``].

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``·``.

