  ... Return xref:find_callableDef_overloaded_t[the overloaded callable definition of ``+.+ nameIR`` ``+(+`` ``argumentIR^{asterisk}^`` ``+)+`` from the ``+GLOBAL+`` layer of ``TC``].
. Else:
 .. If let ``nameIR`` be ``prefixedNameIR``:
  ... Return xref:find_callableDef_overloaded_t[the overloaded callable definition of ``nameIR`` ``+(+`` ``argumentIR^{asterisk}^`` ``+)+`` from the ``+BLOCK+`` layer of ``TC``].
 .. Else:
  ... Return xref:find_callableDef_overloaded_t[the overloaded callable definition of ``+.+ nameIR`` ``+(+`` ``argumentIR^{asterisk}^`` ``+)+`` from the ``+GLOBAL+`` layer of ``TC``].

xref:find_callableDef_non_overloaded_t[The non-overloaded callable definition of ``prefixedNameIR`` from the ``p'`` layer of ``TC``]

. Try:
 .. {empty}
  ... Let!~type~ ``+.+ nameIR`` be ``prefixedNameIR``.

  ... Return ``xref:find_non_overloaded[$find_non_overloaded<callableTypeDefIR>(TC.+GLOBAL+.+CALLABLE+, nameIR)]``.
 .. {empty}
