  ... Result in ``externMethodPrototypeIR``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``typeOrVoid name typeParameterListOpt +(+parameterList+)+`` be ``functionPrototype``.
 .. Let ``nameIR`` be xref:name[the name of ``name``].
 .. Check that ``nameIR`` is not equal to ``typeId~extern~``.

 .. Let context ``TC~1~`` and type parameters ``typeId~expl~^{asterisk}^`` be the result of xref:TypeParameterListOpt_ok[typing ``typeParameterListOpt``, under context ``TC~0~`` at ``+LOCAL+``].
 .. Let ``typeIR~ret~`` and fresh type variables ``typeId^{asterisk}^`` be the result of xref:Type_ok[typing ``typeOrVoid``, under context ``TC~1~`` at ``+LOCAL+``].
