 .. Let ``TC~2~`` be ``TC~1~`` with ``+LOCAL+.+KIND+`` set to ``+EXTERN_METHOD+ +ABSTRACT+ +:+ typeIR~ret~``.
 .. Let context ``TC~3~``, ``parameterIR^{asterisk}^``, and fresh type variables ``typeId~impl~^{asterisk}^`` be the result of xref:ParameterList_ok[typing ``parameterList``, under context ``TC~2~`` at ``+LOCAL+``].
