    ..... {empty}
     ...... Let ``nameIR`` be xref:tableCustomName[the name of ``tableCustomName``].
     ...... Check that ``nameIR`` is not equal to ``"default_action"`` and ``nameIR`` is not equal to ``"size"`` and ``nameIR`` is not equal to ``"largest_priority_wins"`` and ``nameIR`` is not equal to ``"priority_delta"``.

