     ...... Let ``constOptIR`` be xref:flatten_constOpt[the optional const qualifier in ``constOpt``].
     ...... Let ``tablePropertyIR`` be ``annotationList constOptIR +CUSTOM+ nameIR +=+ typedExpressionIR +;+``.
     ...... Result in table context ``TBLC~0'~`` and ``tablePropertyIR``.

