xref:Table_ok[Table_ok]:

* Typing ``tableProperty^{asterisk}^``, under context ``TC``.

. Check that the length of xref:filter_[``tableProperty^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``$is_tableKeysProperty(tableProperty)^{asterisk}^``] is less than or equal to ``1``.

. Check that the length of xref:filter_[``tableProperty^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``$is_tableActionsProperty(tableProperty)^{asterisk}^``] is equal to ``1``.

. If the length of xref:filter_[``tableProperty^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``$is_tableDefaultActionProperty(tableProperty)^{asterisk}^``] is equal to ``0``:
 .. Check that the length of xref:filter_[``tableProperty^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``$is_tableLargestPriorityWinsProperty(tableProperty)^{asterisk}^``] is less than or equal to ``1``.

 .. Let ``TBLC~0~`` be ``xref:empty_tableContext[$empty_tableContext]``.
 .. Let table context ``TBLC~1~`` and ``tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^`` be the result of xref:TableProperties_ok[typing ``tableProperty^{asterisk}^``, under context ``TC`` and table context ``TBLC~0~``].
 .. Let ``( ++_++, callableTypeDefIR )`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:find_callableDef_non_overloaded_t[the non-overloaded callable definition of ``+.+ "NoAction"`` from the ``+LOCAL+`` layer of ``TC``].
 .. Let!~type~ ``++_++ +ACTION+ ++_++ +(+parameterIR^{asterisk}^+)+`` be ``callableTypeDefIR``.

 .. Check that ``parameterIR^{asterisk}^`` is an empty list.

 .. Let ``tablePropertyIR~default_action~`` be ``· +DEFAULT_ACTION+ +=+ "NoAction" · +(+·+)+ +;+``.
 .. Let ``( TBLC~2~, tablePropertyIR~updated~^{asterisk}^ )`` be ``xref:insert_NoAction_tablePropertyIR[$insert_NoAction_tablePropertyIR(TBLC~1~, tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^)]``.
 .. Result in context ``TBLC~2~`` and ``tablePropertyIR~updated~^{asterisk}^`` concatenated with ``tablePropertyIR~default_action~``.
. Else if the length of xref:filter_[``tableProperty^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``$is_tableDefaultActionProperty(tableProperty)^{asterisk}^``] is equal to ``1``:
 .. Check that the length of xref:filter_[``tableProperty^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``$is_tableLargestPriorityWinsProperty(tableProperty)^{asterisk}^``] is less than or equal to ``1``.

 .. Let ``TBLC~0~`` be ``xref:empty_tableContext[$empty_tableContext]``.
 .. Let table context ``TBLC~1~`` and ``tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^`` be the result of xref:TableProperties_ok[typing ``tableProperty^{asterisk}^``, under context ``TC`` and table context ``TBLC~0~``].
 .. Result in context ``TBLC~1~`` and ``tablePropertyIR^{asterisk}^``.

xref:TableType_ok[TableType_ok]:

* Typing ``name``, under context ``TC~0~`` and table context ``TBLC``.

. Let ``nameIR`` be xref:name[the name of ``name``].
. Let ``typeId~enum~`` be ``"action_list("`` concatenated with ``nameIR`` concatenated with ``")"``.
. Let ``( prefixedNameIR~action~ +(+++_++^{asterisk}^ +@+ ++_+++)+ )^{asterisk}^`` be ``TBLC.+ACTIONS+``.
