. Let ``tableMetadataEnumTypeIR`` be ``+TABLE_ENUM+ typeId~enum~ +{+nameIR~enum_field~^{asterisk}^+}+``.
. Let ``value~enum_field~`` be ``+TABLE_ENUM+ typeId~enum~ +.+ nameIR~enum_field~``, for all ``nameIR~enum_field~`` in ``nameIR~enum_field~^{asterisk}^`` and ``value~enum_field~`` in ``value~enum_field~^{asterisk}^``.
. Let ``varTypeIR~enum_field~`` be ``tableMetadataEnumTypeIR +LCTK+ value~enum_field~``, for all ``value~enum_field~`` in ``value~enum_field~^{asterisk}^`` and ``varTypeIR~enum_field~`` in ``varTypeIR~enum_field~^{asterisk}^``.
. Let ``TC~1~`` be xref:add_vars_t[``TC~0~`` where each of ``( typeId~enum~ {pp} "." {pp} nameIR~enum_field~ )^{asterisk}^`` to each of ``varTypeIR~enum_field~^{asterisk}^`` are added to the ``+BLOCK+`` layer].
. Let ``typeId~struct~`` be ``"apply_result("`` concatenated with ``nameIR`` concatenated with ``")"``.
. Let ``tableMetadataStructTypeIR`` be ``+TABLE_STRUCT+ typeId~struct~ +{++HIT+ +BOOL+ +;+ +MISS+ +BOOL+ +;+ +ACTION_RUN+ tableMetadataEnumTypeIR +;++}+``.
. Let ``typeIR~table~`` be ``+TABLE+ nameIR +{+tableMetadataStructTypeIR+}+``.
. Result in context ``TC~1~`` and type of table ``typeIR~table~``.

