 .. Return ``xref:compat_table_lpm_ternary_range_key[$compat_table_lpm_ternary_range_key(typeIR)]``.
. Else if let ``+TYPE+ ++_++ typeIR`` be ``typeIR''``:
 .. Return ``xref:compat_table_lpm_ternary_range_key[$compat_table_lpm_ternary_range_key(typeIR)]``.
. Else:
 .. Return ``xref:compat_table_lpm_ternary_range_key[$compat_table_lpm_ternary_range_key(typeIR)]``.

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``false``.

