  ... Return ``value``.
 .. Else if ``p'`` matches pattern ``+BLOCK+``:
  ... Try:
   .... {empty}
    ..... Let ``value`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:find_map[the value of ``id`` in map ``EC.+BLOCK+.+FRAME+``].
    ..... Return ``value``.
   .... {empty}
    ..... Check that ``·`` is equal to xref:find_map[the value of ``id`` in map ``EC.+BLOCK+.+FRAME+``].

    ..... Return xref:find_var_e[the value of ``id`` from the ``+GLOBAL+`` layer of ``EC``].
 .. Else:
  ... Try:
   .... {empty}
