    ..... Return ``value``.
   .... {empty}
    ..... Check that ``·`` is equal to xref:find_maps[the value of ``id`` in maps ``EC.+LOCAL+.+FRAMES+``].

    ..... Return xref:find_var_e[the value of ``id`` from the ``+BLOCK+`` layer of ``EC``].

xref:find_typeDef_e[$find_typeDef_e(++_++, EC, prefixedNameIR)]

. If let ``nameIR`` be ``prefixedNameIR``:
