xref:init_archState[$init_archState]

xref:add_object_e[$add_object_e(ARCH, objectId, object)]

. Let ``STO`` be xref:add_map[``ARCH.+STORE+`` where ``objectId`` to ``object`` is added].
. Return ``ARCH`` with ``+STORE+`` set to ``STO``.

xref:find_archState_e[$find_archState_e(ARCH)]

. Return ``ARCH.+STATE+``.

xref:find_object_e[The object ``objectId`` in ``ARCH``]

. Return xref:find_map[the value of ``objectId`` in map ``ARCH.+STORE+``].

xref:find_object_qualified_e[$find_object_qualified_e(ARCH, objectId)]

. Return xref:find_object_e[the object ``objectId`` in ``ARCH``].

xref:find_object_unqualified_e[$find_object_unqualified_e(ARCH, id)]

. Let ``+{+( objectId +:+ object )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``ARCH.+STORE+``.
. Let ``object~id~^?^`` be xref:ite[``object`` if ``objectId`` is an object name that ends with ``id`` otherwise ``·``], for all ``object`` in ``object^{asterisk}^``, ``objectId`` in ``objectId^{asterisk}^``, and ``object~id~^?^`` in ``object~id~^?^^{asterisk}^``.
. Let ``object''^?^^{asterisk}^`` be xref:filter_[``object~id~^?^^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``( object~id~^?^ =/= · )^{asterisk}^``].
. Let!~type~ ``object'^?^`` be ``object''^?^^{asterisk}^``.

. Let!~type~ ``object~id_found~`` be ``object'^?^``.

. Return ``object~id_found~``.

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``·``.

xref:find_objectState_e[$find_objectState_e(ARCH, objectId)]

. Let ``object`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:find_object_e[the object ``objectId`` in ``ARCH``].
. Let!~type~ ``externObject`` be ``object``.

. Let ``+EXTERN+ ++_++ +<+++_+++>+ +{+objectState ++_++ ++_+++}+`` be ``externObject``.
. Return ``objectState``.

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``·``.

xref:update_archState_e[$update_archState_e(ARCH, archState)]

. Return ``ARCH`` with ``+STATE+`` set to ``archState``.

xref:update_object_qualified_e[$update_object_qualified_e(ARCH~0~, objectId, object)]

. Check that ``·`` is not equal to ``xref:find_object_qualified_e[$find_object_qualified_e(ARCH~0~, objectId)]``.

. Let ``ARCH~1~`` be ``xref:add_object_e[$add_object_e(ARCH~0~, objectId, object)]``.
. Return ``ARCH~1~``.

xref:update_object_unqualified_e[$update_object_unqualified_e(ARCH~0~, id, object)]

. Let ``+{+( objectId +:+ ++_++ )^{asterisk}^+}+`` be ``ARCH~0~.+STORE+``.
. Let ``objectId~id~^?^`` be xref:ite[``objectId`` if ``objectId`` is an object name that ends with ``id`` otherwise ``·``], for all ``objectId`` in ``objectId^{asterisk}^`` and ``objectId~id~^?^`` in ``objectId~id~^?^^{asterisk}^``.
. Let ``objectId''^?^^{asterisk}^`` be xref:filter_[``objectId~id~^?^^{asterisk}^`` filtered by ``( objectId~id~^?^ =/= · )^{asterisk}^``].
. Let!~type~ ``objectId'^?^`` be ``objectId''^?^^{asterisk}^``.

. Let!~type~ ``objectId~found~`` be ``objectId'^?^``.

. Let ``ARCH~1~`` be ``xref:add_object_e[$add_object_e(ARCH~0~, objectId~found~, object)]``.
. Return ``ARCH~1~``.

xref:update_objectState_e[$update_objectState_e(ARCH~0'~, objectId, objectState)]

. Let ``object`` be xref:option_get[*!*] xref:find_object_e[the object ``objectId`` in ``ARCH~0'~``].
. Let!~type~ ``externObject`` be ``object``.

. Let ``+EXTERN+ typeId +<+theta+>+ +{+++_++ frame externMethodDefEnv+}+`` be ``externObject``.
. Let ``externObject~update~`` be ``+EXTERN+ typeId +<+theta+>+ +{+objectState frame externMethodDefEnv+}+``.
. Let ``ARCH~1~`` be ``xref:add_object_e[$add_object_e(ARCH~0'~, objectId, externObject~update~)]``.
. Return ``ARCH~1~``.

. Otherwise:
 .. Otherwise:
  ... Return ``·``.

