. Else if let ``+SET+ +{+value~base~ +&&&+ value~mask~+}+`` be ``setValue``:
 .. Let ``value'`` be xref:bin_band[``value~base~`` ``+&+`` ``value~mask~``].
 .. Let ``value''`` be xref:bin_band[``value~key~`` ``+&+`` ``value~mask~``].
 .. Return xref:bin_eq[``value'`` ``+==+`` ``value''``].
. Else:
 .. Let ``bool'`` be xref:bin_le[``value~base~`` ``+<=+`` ``value~key~``].
 .. Let ``bool''`` be xref:bin_le[``value~key~`` ``+<=+`` ``value~limit~``].
 .. Return ``bool'`` and ``bool''``.

